# Keep empty in Git (populated by GitHub Action or Git LFS)
# Automated bundler downloads quantized models here at CI time:
# - all-MiniLM-L6-v2-quant.onnx (~23 MB) from https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
# - vocab.txt
#
# For local development with large (>100 MB) GGUF LLM models, side-load via:
#   adb push mymodel.gguf /sdcard/Download/BuildGenie/models/
# or copy to getFilesDir()/models/ inside the app.
# See GITHUB_AND_ANDROID_UPGRADES.md for all three handling options.
